    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Night Painting of Atti&quot; is a unique VR visual novel that invites you into a warm, immersive virtual world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Atti, meets various neighbors while searching for inspiration to paint the night sky. Along the way, they encounter an unexpected figure who helps them complete their masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience is brought to life with a heartfelt story, captivating narration, and stunning visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The approximately 5-10 minute journey is available in multiple languages, including Korean, English, Chinese, and Japanese, for a richer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soothing and emotional storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful VR environments and visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple and accessible interface for everyone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the dreamlike world of &quot;Night Painting of Atti&quot; and experience a touching visual novel adventure today!</p>",
